# Atomic and traceable specification documents

## Rule
- **MUST:** Use small independently identifiable `.iasi` documents for individual ideas, requirements, constraints or coherent specifications.
- **MUST NOT:** Accumulate unrelated requirements into giant multipurpose specification files.
- **MUST:** Preserve many-to-many links between external source documents and generated specifications when known.
- **MUST:** `.iasi` consists of structured front matter and Markdown body; TOML `+++` is the approved corporate baseline representation for these files.
- **SHOULD:** Name files so related rules group together naturally in directory trees (e.g. `complexity-cognitive`, `complexity-cyclomatic`).
